<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Tell us the decision you could not get answered — NESO</title>
<meta name="description" content="If NESO does not already sell what you need, tell us the decision you are trying to make. We answer within a business day and say honestly whether it is something we do.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://nesohq.com/ask.html">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-snippet:-1">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="NESO">
<meta property="og:title" content="Tell us the decision you could not get answered">
<meta property="og:description" content="If NESO does not already sell what you need, say what you are trying to decide. We reply within a business day, honestly.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://nesohq.com/ask.html">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://nesohq.com/og-nesohq.png">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<!--
  ASK NESO · a demand-capture form, deliberately NOT a "request a custom tool" form.
  The distinction matters: inviting bespoke builds invites scope that cannot be
  priced and that is 100% principal time — the inverse of how NESO works. Asking
  what somebody could not get answered captures the same information, promises
  nothing, and is free to be wrong about.
  Posts to neso-queue /submit as form:"ask", so it is counted like every other route
  in and a response clock runs against it.
-->
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root{--plum:#5B2A86;--plumD:#3d1a5c;--gold:#B8860B;--ink:#23272e;--dim:#5c6672;--faint:#98a1ab;
--line:#e5ddd0;--bg:#f7f4fb;--card:#fff;--green:#0e8a6e}
body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);
line-height:1.55;font-size:15px}
.wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 70px}
header{background:var(--card);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:15px 0}
header .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding-bottom:0}
header b{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:17px}
header span{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--faint)}
.hero{padding:40px 0 6px}
.eye{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;
text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--plum);font-weight:600}
h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4.4vw,36px);line-height:1.1;margin:11px 0 12px;max-width:22ch}
.lead{color:var(--dim);font-size:16px;max-width:62ch}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px;margin-top:22px}
label{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dim);margin:16px 0 5px}
label:first-child{margin-top:0}
label .req{color:#b91c1c}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);
border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:11px 12px}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:2px solid var(--plum);outline-offset:1px;border-color:transparent}
textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
.hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.5}
.btn{font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;background:var(--plum);color:#fff;border:none;
border-radius:999px;padding:13px 28px;cursor:pointer;margin-top:20px}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
.msg{margin-top:13px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
.msg.ok{color:var(--green)} .msg.err{color:#b91c1c}
.done{display:none;background:#f0faf6;border:1px solid var(--green);border-radius:14px;padding:26px 24px;margin-top:22px}
.done h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:21px;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:8px}
.done p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--dim)}
h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;margin:34px 0 10px}
.three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:13px}
.three div{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:15px 17px}
.three b{display:block;font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:4px}
.three span{font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.5}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:36px;padding:18px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--faint)}
footer a{color:inherit}
</style></head><body>

<header><div class="wrap">
  <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="44" height="44" rx="10" fill="#160f1e"/>
  <path d="M5 22 L22 19.4 L39 22 L22 24.6 Z" fill="#5B2A86"/><path d="M22 5 L24.6 22 L22 39 L19.4 22 Z" fill="#E7B84B"/>
  <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="2.4" fill="#f2ecf7"/></svg>
  <b>NESO</b><span>nesohq.com</span>
</div></header>

<div class="wrap">
<div class="hero">
  <div class="eye">Ask NESO</div>
  <h1>Tell us the decision you could not get answered.</h1>
  <p class="lead">NESO sells eight tools, four written reports and advisory work in credits. If none of them answers
  what you are actually trying to decide, say so here. We would rather know.</p>
</div>

<h2>What happens to what you send</h2>
<div class="three">
  <div><b>We already do it</b><span>You get told which product, what it costs and how long it takes &mdash; usually the same business day.</span></div>
  <div><b>Several people want it</b><span>We build it. You hear first, and you are not charged for having asked.</span></div>
  <div><b>It is not for us</b><span>We say so plainly, and point you at who does it if we know. That answer is free too.</span></div>
</div>

<div class="card" id="formCard">
  <label>What are you trying to decide? <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <textarea id="need" placeholder="e.g. whether to keep our building or sell it and lease · whether this site can take a 40,000 SF addition · what our facility is worth against what a move would cost"></textarea>
  <div class="hint">The decision, not the product. We are better at pointing you somewhere useful when we know what
  hangs on the answer.</div>

  <label>What have you already tried?</label>
  <input id="tried" placeholder="Optional — a broker, an engineer, a spreadsheet, nothing yet">
  <div class="hint">Tells us where the gap is. &ldquo;Nothing yet&rdquo; is a perfectly good answer.</div>

  <label>Is there a date this has to be decided by?</label>
  <input id="by" placeholder="Optional — a lease expiry, a board meeting, a closing">

  <label>Your name <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <input id="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="First and last">

  <label>Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <input id="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com">

  <label>Company and your role</label>
  <input id="org" placeholder="Optional — helps us judge what would actually be useful">

  <button class="btn" id="send">Send it</button>
  <div class="msg" id="msg"></div>
</div>

<div class="done" id="doneMsg">
  <h3>Got it &mdash; thank you</h3>
  <p><b>A principal reads every one of these personally.</b> You will hear back within a business day with one of the
  three answers above. If the honest answer is that you do not need us, that is the answer you will get.</p>
  <p style="margin-top:12px"><a href="https://nesohq.com/" style="color:var(--plum);font-weight:700">Back to nesohq.com &rarr;</a></p>
</div>

<footer>NESO HQ LLC &middot; advisory &amp; tools for business and real estate &middot;
<a href="https://nesohq.com/">nesohq.com</a> &middot; Text (901) 295-0322<br>
We answer these ourselves. Nothing you send here is added to a mailing list.</footer>
</div>

<script>
var QUEUE = "https://neso-queue.nesoai-us.workers.dev/submit";
function $(i){ return document.getElementById(i); }

$("send").addEventListener("click", async function(){
  var miss = [];
  if(!$("need").value.trim()) miss.push("what you are trying to decide");
  if(!$("name").value.trim()) miss.push("your name");
  if(!$("email").value.trim()) miss.push("your email");
  if(miss.length){
    $("msg").className = "msg err";
    $("msg").textContent = "Still needed: " + miss.join(", ") + ".";
    return;
  }
  $("send").disabled = true;
  $("msg").className = "msg"; $("msg").textContent = "Sending\u2026";
  try{
    var r = await fetch(QUEUE, {
      method: "POST", headers: {"Content-Type":"application/json"},
      body: JSON.stringify({ form: "ask", fields: {
        ask_decision: $("need").value.trim(),
        ask_tried:    $("tried").value.trim(),
        ask_by:       $("by").value.trim(),
        ask_name:     $("name").value.trim(),
        ask_email:    $("email").value.trim(),
        ask_org:      $("org").value.trim(),
        ask_source:   (new URLSearchParams(location.search)).get("source") || "direct"
      }})
    });
    var j = await r.json();
    if(!j || !j.ok) throw new Error((j && j.error) || "rejected");
    $("formCard").style.display = "none";
    $("doneMsg").style.display = "block";
    window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:"smooth"});
  }catch(e){
    $("send").disabled = false;
    $("msg").className = "msg err";
    $("msg").textContent = "That did not send (" + e.message + "). Try again, or text (901) 295-0322.";
  }
});
</script>
</body></html>
